{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15965","headline":"雉将雏 · 王建","name":"雉将雏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雉咿喔，雏出㲉，毛斑斑，觜啄啄。\n学飞未得一尺高，还逐母行旋母脚。\n麦垄浅浅难蔽身，远去恋雏低怕人。\n时时土中鼓两翅，引雏拾虫不相离。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}